DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43189::$$$message_0362_0000_0000$$$::"Where are we? It looks like the kid's house."::
43190::$$$message_0362_0000_0001$$$::"I've made a blunder... This is a Reality Marble."::
43191::$$$message_0362_0000_0002$$$::"...Huh?"::
43192::$$$message_0362_0000_0003$$$::"I guess I should say it's nice to meet you, punching bag characters. [l][wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg char=藤ねえ face=怒 time=200][hfangry layer=0][say storage=HKOT6_TIG_0020 _name=藤ねえ]Especially the blue guy!"::
43193::$$$message_0362_0000_0004$$$::"Wait, me?"::
43194::$$$message_0362_0000_0005$$$::"Yeah, you. You didn't even manage to send Shirou here once, you worthless antagonist!"::
43195::$$$message_0362_0000_0006$$$::"There actually isn't a single game-over where Lancer kills him."::
43196::$$$message_0362_0000_0007$$$::"...What the hell are they on about?"::
43197::$$$message_0362_0000_0008$$$::"They speak the language of another world. No need to pay it any mind."::
43198::$$$message_0362_0000_0009$$$::"Anyway! If you thought you could ignore us and try to get an onsen for yourself, you're sadly mistaken!"::
43199::$$$message_0362_0000_0010$$$::"It belongs to me to begin with, so it's pretty cheeky of you to try and steal it."::
43200::$$$message_0362_0000_0011$$$::"Hmph! Then I simply need to make you surrender it to me."::
43201::$$$message_0362_0000_0012$$$::"S-surrender? [l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=うーん2 time=200][say storage=HKOT6_TIG_0070 _name=藤ねえ]Hey, Disciple Number One. That blond guy sounds really violent, but also kinda freaky, you know what I mean?"::
43202::$$$message_0362_0000_0013$$$::"It's okay. He talks a big game, but he never managed to take Saber from Shirou."::
43203::$$$message_0362_0000_0014$$$::"Heh... Hehehehehe.[lr]::
43204::$$$message_0362_0000_0015$$$::Let's kill them. Right now. I want them dead."::
43205::$$$message_0362_0000_0016$$$::"Oh, man... I don't really want to hurt women and children..."::
43206::$$$message_0362_0001_0000$$$::"It's nothing personal. Just let us knock you out and you won't have to put up with them anymore."::
43207::$$$message_0362_0001_0001$$$::"We have to deal with them to exit this space, regardless."::
43208::$$$message_0362_0001_0002$$$::"Don't worry. This is Master's Reality Marble, so you only have to beat her."::
43209::$$$message_0362_0001_0003$$$::"W-why would you tell them that [font italic=true]now[font italic=false]!?"::
43210::$$$message_0362_0001_0004$$$::"Hehe. Didn't you know? You can inherit Reality Marbles."::
43211::$$$message_0362_0001_0005$$$::"...Is [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] what you're after!?"::
43213::$$$message_0362_0001_0007$$$::"Let's give it a shot! Woo-hoo!":0�